From: mscharged-port
Subject: Open the disc image by path so split images read as one
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

aurora_dvd_open read the image through one SDL file stream, so nod saw only
the named file. An image split into several files (WBFS .wbfs + .wbf1, ISO
.iso + .iso.1 or .part1.iso) then ended after its first part, although the
launcher's check, which opens the image by path, read it whole. nod_disc_open
finds and joins the parts itself; the preloader option is unchanged.

